@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Refuel AI Supplements V6.4.62 — product viewing, inventory and flavor choices
+
+Product pages and PWA quick view now show a short-lived count of active viewers, actual WooCommerce stock quantities when inventory is managed, and a favorites heart saved on this device. Variable products show button choices driven by WooCommerce attributes and variation availability; the native form still handles selection and cart validation. Simple products without configured variations do not invent flavor options. The viewer count is measured from active browser tabs seen within the last 90 seconds and only appears when its live request succeeds. Stock and viewer counts refresh while the product is open.
+
+Install this ZIP as a theme update in WordPress. To show flavor choices, configure the product as a variable product with Flavor attributes and variations in WooCommerce. This update does not change product records. Includes all changes through V6.4.61.
